{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40920163c12ad9f3ce69942d9b625b88ac82923f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/e/02e28efa00c4f2c66d1aa381c0cb1f8e0ef8d6e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/2/782e44edb6e97c81baf9af129472fc9a782b4272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x)^{\\log_b 2}-(3x)^{\\log_b 3}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"188\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/5/6a5c6bc04663ee1fef9a4e20d5d8411c82d03f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{216}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{1}{6}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"544\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use rules of logarithms to solve this equation.  \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845e162fbf47141d2442a3975785f4382857acfc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2x)^{\\log_{b} 2} = (3x)^{\\log_{b} 3}\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/e/e2eb649b11eaca610b77af875f6d40cf035ea462.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b} 2 \\cdot \\log_{b} 2x = \\log_{b} 3 \\cdot \\log_{b} 3x\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/4/3f4e59028a7c0990667dac81817bdaed3140ce79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b} 2 \\cdot (\\log_{b} 2 + \\log_{b} x) = \\log_{b} 3 \\cdot (\\log_{b} 3 + \\log_{b} x)\\]\" width=\"377\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a63882e9b417f4f85eaf3ceb58ca21f1b1957dc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_{b} 2)^2  + \\log_{b} 2 \\cdot \\log_{b} x = (\\log_{b} 3)^2 + \\log_{b} 3 \\cdot \\log_{b} x\\]\" width=\"392\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e05d1a6b1c8309c7fe6bab2947a5ecc1dd2e61b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_{b} 2)^2 - (\\log_{b} 3)^2  =  \\log_{b} 3 \\cdot \\log_{b} x - \\log_{b} 2 \\cdot \\log_{b} x\\]\" width=\"392\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/7/f678d0fadfaeaffb6aca8c2ee89eee9cc65fd702.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(\\log_{b} 2 + \\log_{b} 3)(\\log_{b} 2 - \\log_{b} 3) = \\log_{b} x \\cdot (\\log_{b} 3 - \\log_{b} 2)\\]\" width=\"440\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/31032e3cdf0e9c8148a509d74e7f8a5d5830a08e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b} 2 + \\log_{b} 3 = -\\log_{b} x\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810f5c0415ce5db08247412fc55b20879a50c2b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{b} 6 = -\\log_{b} x\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/00438f3c9ebb157e62315fc6c51c9595953f56b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6 = \\frac{1}{x}\\]\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/8/93877b7c27d9cecb7370ea3f819c9b944963531c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = \\boxed {(\\textbf{B})\\ \\frac{1}{6}}\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/